<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Oara Store | فخامة لا مثيل لها</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,600;0,700&family=Tajawal:wght@300;400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --black:#000000;
    --charcoal:#0b0b0b;
    --panel:#121110;
    --line:#2a2620;
    --gold-1:#B8860B;
    --gold-2:#D4AF37;
    --gold-3:#FFD700;
    --gold-soft:#e9c766;
    --ivory:#F3EFE6;
    --muted:#9a9488;
    --danger:#c0392b;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--black);
    color:var(--ivory);
    font-family:'Tajawal',sans-serif;
    overflow-x:hidden;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:'Tajawal',sans-serif;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0;}
  a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit;}
  ul{list-style:none;}
  button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;color:inherit;}
  img{display:block;max-width:100%;}
  .brand-latin{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;}

  .gold-text{
    background:linear-gradient(100deg, var(--gold-1) 0%, var(--gold-3) 20%, var(--gold-soft) 40%, var(--gold-1) 60%, var(--gold-3) 80%, var(--gold-1) 100%);
    background-size:250% auto;
    -webkit-background-clip:text;
    background-clip:text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
    animation:shimmer 6s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes shimmer{
    0%{background-position:0% center;}
    100%{background-position:250% center;}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .gold-text{animation:none;background-position:0 0;}
    *{animation-duration:.001ms !important; transition-duration:.001ms !important;}
  }

  .btn-gold{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
    padding:14px 32px;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--gold-1),var(--gold-3) 50%,var(--gold-1));
    background-size:200% auto;
    color:#0a0a0a;
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0;
    font-size:.85rem;
    border-radius:2px;
    transition:background-position .5s ease, transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
    box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(212,175,55,.15);
  }
  .btn-gold:hover{background-position:100% center;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(212,175,55,.3);}
  .btn-outline{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
    padding:13px 30px;
    border:1px solid var(--gold-2);
    color:var(--gold-2);
    font-weight:600;font-size:.82rem;
    border-radius:2px;transition:.3s ease;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover{background:var(--gold-2);color:#0a0a0a;}

  /* ---------- Announcement bar ---------- */
  .announce{
    background:#0a0a0a;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    text-align:center;
    padding:9px 12px;
    font-size:.78rem;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    color:var(--gold-soft);
    position:relative;z-index:60;
  }
  .announce b{color:var(--gold-3);}

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  header{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.85);
    backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-wrap{
    max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:16px 28px;
  }
  .logo{
    font-size:1.7rem;
    font-weight:700;
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
    background:none;border:none;
  }
  .logo .seal{
    width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;
    border:1.4px solid var(--gold-2);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;
    color:var(--gold-3);
    box-shadow:inset 0 0 8px rgba(212,175,55,.25), 0 0 10px rgba(212,175,55,.15);
  }
  nav.main-nav{display:flex;gap:34px;}
  nav.main-nav button{
    font-size:.88rem;color:var(--ivory);
    position:relative;padding:6px 0;font-weight:500;
  }
  nav.main-nav button::after{
    content:'';position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;width:0;height:1px;background:var(--gold-3);transition:width .3s ease;
  }
  nav.main-nav button:hover::after,nav.main-nav button.active::after{width:100%;}
  nav.main-nav button:hover, nav.main-nav button.active{color:var(--gold-3);}

  .nav-icons{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;}
  .icon-btn{position:relative;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ivory);transition:.25s;}
  .icon-btn:hover{color:var(--gold-3);}
  .cart-count{
    position:absolute;top:-8px;left:-10px;
    background:var(--gold-3);color:#000;
    font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;
    width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  }
  .burger{display:none;font-size:1.3rem;}

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    min-height:92vh;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;position:relative;
    padding:120px 20px 80px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(212,175,55,.09), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,#000 0%, #050504 100%);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
    background-image:
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, transparent 79px, rgba(212,175,55,.035) 80px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 79px, rgba(212,175,55,.035) 80px);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow{
    font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--gold-soft);
    margin-bottom:22px;z-index:1;font-weight:600;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.3rem,6.5vw,4.6rem);
    line-height:1.3;
    z-index:1;
    max-width:900px;
    font-weight:900;
  }
  .hero p.sub{
    margin-top:22px;max-width:560px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem;line-height:2;z-index:1;
  }
  .hero-ctas{margin-top:38px;display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;z-index:1;}
  .hero-seal-line{
    margin-top:70px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.05em;z-index:1;
  }
  .hero-seal-line span.dash{width:40px;height:1px;background:var(--line);}

  /* ---------- Section shell ---------- */
  section{padding:100px 24px;}
  .section-head{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto 46px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;}
  .section-head .tag{font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--gold-soft);margin-bottom:10px;display:block;font-weight:600;}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);}
  .divider-line{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--line),transparent);}

  /* ---------- Category tabs ---------- */
  .cat-tabs{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto 44px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .cat-tab{
    padding:10px 24px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;
    font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);
    transition:.3s;font-weight:500;
  }
  .cat-tab:hover{border-color:var(--gold-2);color:var(--gold-2);}
  .cat-tab.active{background:var(--gold-2);color:#0a0a0a;border-color:var(--gold-2);font-weight:700;}

  /* ---------- Product grid ---------- */
  .grid{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px;}
  .card{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:4px;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:transform .35s ease, border-color .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease;
    position:relative;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  }
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:var(--gold-2);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.5);}
  .card .img-wrap{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1;overflow:hidden;background:#050504;}
  .card .img-wrap img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .6s ease;filter:saturate(.92) contrast(1.03);}
  .card:hover .img-wrap img{transform:scale(1.07);}
  .badge{
    position:absolute;top:12px;right:12px;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,#8a0f0f,#c0392b);
    color:#fff;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;
    padding:6px 11px;border-radius:2px;
    box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  }
  .card-body{padding:20px 20px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;flex:1;}
  .card-cat{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted);}
  .card-title{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;}
  .stars{display:flex;gap:3px;color:var(--gold-2);font-size:.85rem;}
  .stars .empty{color:#3a352a;}
  .price-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:2px;}
  .price{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold-3);}
  .price-old{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:line-through;}
  .add-btn{
    margin-top:10px;padding:11px;border:1px solid var(--gold-2);color:var(--gold-2);
    font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;border-radius:2px;
    transition:.3s;
  }
  .add-btn:hover{background:var(--gold-2);color:#0a0a0a;}

  /* ---------- Banner strip ---------- */
  .bf-banner{
    max-width:1280px;margin:80px auto 0;
    border:1px solid var(--gold-2);
    border-radius:4px;
    padding:46px 40px;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;
    background:linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(212,175,55,.08), transparent 60%), #0a0a09;
    position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .bf-banner::after{
    content:'BLACK FRIDAY';position:absolute;left:-10px;bottom:-38px;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:5.5rem;font-weight:700;
    color:rgba(212,175,55,.05);white-space:nowrap;pointer-events:none;
  }
  .bf-banner h3{font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--gold-3);}
  .bf-banner p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;max-width:420px;}

  /* ---------- Reviews ---------- */
  .reviews-wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:50px;}
  .review-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;}
  .review-card{
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:24px 26px;
  }
  .review-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .reviewer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
  .avatar{
    width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold-1),var(--gold-3));
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#000;font-weight:800;
  }
  .reviewer-name{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;}
  .review-text{color:#cfc9bc;font-size:.98rem;line-height:2.1;}

  .review-form{
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:30px;height:fit-content;
    position:sticky;top:110px;
  }
  .review-form h3{font-size:1.35rem;margin-bottom:18px;}
  .field{margin-bottom:16px;}
  .field label{display:block;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:500;}
  .field input, .field select, .field textarea{
    width:100%;background:#0a0a0a;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ivory);
    padding:12px 14px;font-size:.92rem;border-radius:2px;font-family:inherit;
  }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus, .field textarea:focus{outline:1px solid var(--gold-2);border-color:var(--gold-2);}
  .field textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:90px;}
  .star-picker{display:flex;gap:6px;font-size:1.4rem;color:#3a352a;cursor:pointer;}
  .star-picker span.on{color:var(--gold-2);}

  /* ---------- Trust / Footer ---------- */
  footer{background:#050504;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:80px 24px 30px;}
  .footer-top{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr;gap:50px;padding-bottom:50px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .footer-top h4{color:var(--gold-2);font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:18px;font-weight:700;}
  .footer-top p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.9;}
  .footer-top ul li{margin-bottom:10px;}
  .footer-top ul li a{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;transition:.25s;}
  .footer-top ul li a:hover{color:var(--gold-3);}
  .trust-badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:8px;}
  .trust-badge{
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
    border:1px solid var(--gold-2);border-radius:30px;
    padding:9px 16px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gold-2);font-weight:500;
    box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(212,175,55,.08);
  }
  .trust-badge .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold-3);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--gold-3);}
  .footer-bottom{max-width:1280px;margin:26px auto 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.82rem;}

  /* ---------- Cart Drawer ---------- */
  .overlay{
    position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);
    opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .35s ease;z-index:90;
  }
  .overlay.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;}
  .drawer{
    position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:100%;width:420px;max-width:92vw;
    background:#0a0a09;border-left:1px solid var(--line);
    transform:translateX(-100%);transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.19,1,.22,1);
    z-index:95;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  }
  .drawer.open{transform:translateX(0);}
  .drawer-head{padding:24px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
  .drawer-head h3{font-size:1.35rem;}
  .close-x{font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--muted);transition:.25s;}
  .close-x:hover{color:var(--gold-3);}
  .drawer-items{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:16px 26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;}
  .drawer-items::-webkit-scrollbar{width:5px;}
  .drawer-items::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--line);}
  .cart-empty{color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin-top:60px;font-size:.92rem;}
  .cart-item{display:flex;gap:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:18px;}
  .cart-item img{width:70px;height:70px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:3px;}
  .ci-info{flex:1;}
  .ci-title{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600;}
  .ci-price{color:var(--gold-3);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:4px;}
  .qty-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:8px;}
  .qty-btn{width:24px;height:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ivory);font-size:.85rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:2px;}
  .qty-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold-2);color:var(--gold-2);}
  .remove-btn{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;text-decoration:underline;margin-top:8px;display:inline-block;}
  .remove-btn:hover{color:var(--danger);}
  .drawer-foot{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 26px 26px;}
  .promo-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .promo-row input{flex:1;background:#0a0a0a;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ivory);padding:11px 12px;font-size:.88rem;border-radius:2px;}
  .promo-row button{border:1px solid var(--gold-2);color:var(--gold-2);padding:0 16px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;border-radius:2px;}
  .promo-row button:hover{background:var(--gold-2);color:#0a0a0a;}
  .promo-msg{font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:12px;min-height:14px;}
  .promo-msg.ok{color:#7fbf6a;}
  .promo-msg.err{color:#c0392b;}
  .sum-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;}
  .sum-row.total{color:var(--ivory);font-size:1.08rem;font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
  .sum-row.total .amt{color:var(--gold-3);}

  /* ---------- Modals ---------- */
  .modal{
    position:fixed;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-46%);
    width:420px;max-width:90vw;max-height:88vh;overflow-y:auto;
    background:#0d0c0a;border:1px solid var(--gold-2);border-radius:6px;
    padding:38px 32px;z-index:99;
    opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .35s ease, transform .35s ease;
    box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.7);
  }
  .modal.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);}
  .modal .close-x{position:absolute;top:18px;left:20px;}
  .modal-seal{width:52px;height:52px;border:1.4px solid var(--gold-2);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--gold-3);margin:0 auto 18px;}
  .modal h3{text-align:center;font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .modal .modal-sub{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;margin-bottom:26px;}
  .auth-tabs{display:flex;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;padding:4px;margin-bottom:24px;}
  .auth-tabs button{flex:1;padding:9px;font-size:.82rem;border-radius:26px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;}
  .auth-tabs button.active{background:var(--gold-2);color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:700;}
  .skip-link{display:block;text-align:center;margin-top:16px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline;}
  .skip-link:hover{color:var(--gold-3);}
  .full-btn{width:100%;}

  .checkout-summary{background:#0a0a0a;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:22px;max-height:180px;overflow-y:auto;}
  .co-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);padding:6px 0;}
  .co-item span:last-child{color:var(--ivory);}

  .toast{
    position:fixed;bottom:28px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(30px);
    background:#0d0c0a;border:1px solid var(--gold-2);color:var(--gold-3);
    padding:14px 26px;border-radius:30px;font-size:.9rem;z-index:200;
    opacity:0;transition:.4s ease;pointer-events:none;
    box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);}

  /* Responsive */
  @media(max-width:980px){
    .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .reviews-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .review-form{position:static;}
    .footer-top{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
  }
  @media(max-width:680px){
    nav.main-nav{display:none;}
    .burger{display:block;}
    .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .footer-top{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    section{padding:70px 18px;}
    .drawer{width:100%;}
    .bf-banner{flex-direction:column;text-align:center;}
  }
  nav.mobile-nav{
    display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:0;background:#000;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav.mobile-nav.open{display:flex;}
  nav.mobile-nav button{padding:16px 28px;text-align:right;font-size:.9rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ivory);}
  nav.mobile-nav button.active{color:var(--gold-3);}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="announce">✦ عروض بلاك فرايدي الآن — خصم <b>15%</b> على كامل المتجر مع كود <b>BLACKFRIDAY15</b> ✦</div>

<header>
  <div class="nav-wrap">
    <button class="logo" onclick="scrollToTop()" aria-label="Oara Store — الصفحة الرئيسية">
      <span class="seal">O</span><span class="gold-text brand-latin">oara store</span>
    </button>
    <nav class="main-nav">
      <button data-cat="all" class="active" onclick="filterCategory('all', this)">الكل</button>
      <button data-cat="Accessories" onclick="filterCategory('Accessories', this)">الإكسسوارات</button>
      <button data-cat="Watches" onclick="filterCategory('Watches', this)">الساعات</button>
      <button data-cat="Clothing" onclick="filterCategory('Clothing', this)">الملابس</button>
      <button onclick="scrollToId('reviews')">التقييمات</button>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-icons">
      <button class="icon-btn" title="الحساب" onclick="openAuthModal()">👤</button>
      <button class="icon-btn" title="السلة" onclick="openCart()">
        🛍️<span class="cart-count" id="cartCount">0</span>
      </button>
      <button class="burger" onclick="toggleMobileNav()">☰</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="mobile-nav" id="mobileNav">
